[{"title":"赠新蔡李生 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"十日平原酒未醒，千回谑浪不曾停。\n从他娄水能如眼，可似王家伯仲青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12626,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠新蔡李生 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"缥缈楼前玉万家，银瓶美酒不须赊。\n请看正月江南雪，争似河南二月花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12627,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅徐文果","author":"王世贞","text":"雪压湖绵鲙水晶，书邮岁岁不曾停。\n纵然苕霅如双眼，可似徐郎分外青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12628,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠封比部金翁 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"绯衫不碍鬓丝苍，令子承恩在帝乡。\n欲识故园山色好，一官犹号白云郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12629,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠封比部金翁 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"龙章亲捧帝音归，七十兼闻自古稀。\n种得秫田都是酒，不须随处典朝衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12630,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠苏山人","author":"王世贞","text":"读君鹦鹉怨中辞，何似东方爱滑稽。\n俳调一成天笑动，黄金将出换蛾眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12631,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金翁八十矣为小祇园作新词游戏三昧语走笔为谢 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"长千里头春事繁，家家玉树待君翻。\n多情却是频伽鸟，自谱仙音供世尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12632,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金翁八十矣为小祇园作新词游戏三昧语走笔为谢 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"词场海内旧知名，到处烟花月旦评。\n若使维摩天女在，白莲将赠古先生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12633,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瓜步山","author":"王世贞","text":"佛狸南牧已千秋，百草犹沾毳殿愁。\n驱得王庭还大漠，高皇九叶奠神州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12634,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登蛾眉亭有感","author":"王世贞","text":"回首江南黯澹云，蛾眉亭畔思纷纷。\n何因却作姑溪水，流到长江尚不分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12635,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望钟山","author":"王世贞","text":"划成天堑抱天关，铁马戈船日日閒。\n九叶神孙当北极，千年紫气满钟山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12636,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄石矶","author":"王世贞","text":"黄石矶头波乱流，前军铙吹后宫愁。\n莫因鱼服怜牙爪，自有真龙在上游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12637,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阻风安庆","author":"王世贞","text":"长怜拙宦似今朝，愁水愁风上汉遥。\n何似长年回鹢去，满帆秋色下枫桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12638,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"从彭泽望庐山决策往游示同舟者","author":"王世贞","text":"看尽千峰意不关，青天忽接是庐山。\n来朝紫气君休怪，身在嵯峨峭旧间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12639,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"董中丞淑化寄饷酒赀","author":"王世贞","text":"浔阳江波波刺天，峭风偏对下江船。\n从他九日滩头坐，乞得中丞买酒钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12640,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九江道中大风","author":"王世贞","text":"乌头千树捲秋蓬，乱激飞涛拍大空。\n坐起船窗浑不觉，此生原惯石尤风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12641,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江口望鄱阳湖感事","author":"王世贞","text":"十万楼船不得骄，洪波血立注青霄。\n天弧一举旄头落，不似浔阳枉射鲛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12642,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过九江风迅不克上匡庐自嘲","author":"王世贞","text":"月满清尊霞满裾，何人不信上匡庐。\n东风一夜吹帆去，估客江陵也不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12643,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江州问琵琶亭","author":"王世贞","text":"亦知迁地胜长沙，无那中年易忆家。\n裁唱楚歌头便白，不须遥夜听琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12644,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏题赤壁","author":"王世贞","text":"越州兰亭千载奇，黄州赤壁今半之。\n若使舟人不解说，一拳顽石草迷离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12645,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道士洑","author":"王世贞","text":"西塞山头啼杜鹃，湔涛百尺泻楼船。\n总令渔父心无事，耐可中流倚醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12646,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊樊口","author":"王世贞","text":"千条弱缕拂轻罗，尽日无风少见波。\n不到武昌应不恨，一尊樊口听渔歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12647,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶览元白长庆集有感逝者","author":"王世贞","text":"莫悲长庆元丞死，更觅刘郎伴白头。\n何事调高酬不得，一生春雪半生愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12648,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"程孟孺谒余武昌以是日至而余以是日发因偕登庐岳各返故里遂成二绝为赠并呈豫章诸王孙 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"君作游人上武昌，我为迁客下浔阳。\n何如一醉匡庐色，归卧沧江紫气傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12649,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"程孟孺谒余武昌以是日至而余以是日发因偕登庐岳各返故里遂成二绝为赠并呈豫章诸王孙 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"豫章隆准汉王孙，推食能将国士论。\n君去但誇庐岳好，此曹无念落朱门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12650,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小饮东林戏成","author":"王世贞","text":"双旌曙色转逶迤，那似门人篮笋迟。\n今日白莲无酒禁，可知游客不攒眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12651,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余次得邸报姚继文少卿南太常予卿太仆因寄一绝","author":"王世贞","text":"我徙苍梧君豫章，君游留省我金阊。\n司空自有华阴土，一拭能令两剑霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12652,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄用晦君颇事丹术聊此志规","author":"王世贞","text":"彭蠡春流白雪声，小山朱邸暮云横。\n枕中那得无鸿宝，其若当年误更生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12653,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭王君载四绝 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"娄江云色黯芊眠，知道王家玉不全。\n七尺并埋千卷去，的应天上胜顽仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12654,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭王君载四绝 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"休论骑马与衣朱，一领襕衫未破除。\n欲向文君探旧草，可怜强半制科书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12655,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭王君载四绝 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"耳边犹似叹高山，忽断飘风去不还。\n君到夜台无李白，也堪惆怅忆人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12656,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭王君载四绝 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"围棋诗酒黯然收，便好风光懒去游。\n若向菜蔬新算过，可能无泪滴心头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12657,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上别黄生 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"东风吹冷软金卮，抛尽江南桃李枝。\n佳丽不关垂柳事，春来偏自解成丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12658,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上别黄生 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"睡醒双箸印微红，小立江干怨晓风。\n莫问长安天近远，酒人多在梦魂中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12659,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠袭克懋文学","author":"王世贞","text":"潦倒青衫也不贫，济南诗样诵来新。\n相逢莫怪难分手，白雪楼中纵酒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12660,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"克懋藏于鳞卷后","author":"王世贞","text":"只字能令白雪高，银钩数纸不辞劳。\n青箱欲鐍应须鐍，闻道人间购凤毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12661,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题于鳞集后","author":"王世贞","text":"千秋白雪成真赏，语向斯人已不知。\n犹胜伯牙弦绝后，一生无处觅钟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12662,"sha256":"ed4816f919f