a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郭舜举祠部新婚 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"才子当今顾彦先，燕中花柳胜伊川。\n自从二陆为文友，乞得云间赠妇篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12669,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郭舜举祠部新婚 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"红蜡初镕双凤皇，新诗句好自催妆。\n不须谈到如皋后，一笑先应唤郭郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12670,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅许殿卿长史 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"莲花簇就济南山，湖上看山尽日閒。\n一札十行文似锦，非关长史恋人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12671,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅许殿卿长史 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"拂袖淮王桂树云，远游名字不教闻。\n自从深得山阴趣，玉室金庭报右军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12672,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅许殿卿长史 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"亲扶豢角汶阳田，不向东风费酒钱。\n拥彗苍头誇诵赋，搊筝小伎解参禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12673,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅许殿卿长史 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"踏青风满白杨枝，云到牙山黯自迟。\n冢上弹琴应莫怪，人间能得几钟期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12674,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅许殿卿长史 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"盻子城边春打围，割鲜呼酒去如飞。\n一从上客申屠府，不道袁丝罢相归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12675,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅许殿卿长史 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"绣斧朱钲引碧油，风光差胜廿年游。\n东州耆旧毋劳羡，镜里清霜半上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12676,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清源杂咏 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"绣衣柱史何昂藏，自免不复称为郎。\n尊前凤舞花难夜，门外乌啼月是霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12677,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清源杂咏 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"郑老揖余过郑园，卖文钱尽强开樽。\n那知昔日曾游赵，双璧由来祇片言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12678,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清源杂咏 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"清源十日东风颠，陈家从事绝可怜。\n不须伏尔誇投辖，我自能停步口船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12679,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清源杂咏 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"客肠郁郁谁为开，任侠何如汪秀才。\n仲冬霜冽不解冷，有时自挟春风来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12680,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过分水作","author":"王世贞","text":"一水双分作顺流，风帆唤月不须收。\n拈将印渚脩龄语，翘足微吟下济州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12681,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈司训之仁和 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"七百里多平水面，江南大抵是仙官。\n宝带桥头别亲旧，莺花一路到临安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12682,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈司训之仁和 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"西湖是处美人妆，天竺松风吹绕梁。\n便携罢讲诸生去，何必誇他马季长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12683,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送沈司训之仁和 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"手板抛来尽日閒，吴峰青比玉峰殷。\n若语傍人应不分，一生长对案头山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12684,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"投慈氏寺宿 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"日落山门闭未曾，苾刍前揖大中丞。\n驺呵散尽篝灯语，元是人间行脚僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12685,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"投慈氏寺宿 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"入门金像欣然笑，笑我津梁老此生。\n兜率天中观自在，不知贤剑也求名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12686,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪后问春申台","author":"王世贞","text":"寿州城内春申台，片片寒花飞作堆。\n令尹玉缨看不见，舍人珠履踏还来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12687,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事题小亭 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"过雨山城绿欲齐，一群娇鸟踏枝低。\n不知谢豹今何处，应在春明门外啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12688,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事题小亭 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"铃阁沈沈草檄稀，桑榆虽好傍斜晖。\n莫嗔腐鼠将鸱嚇，元是鹓雏出世非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12689,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对花","author":"王世贞","text":"一春孤负一春天，半日强拚半日眠。\n酒病畏深诗畏浅，将何别策向花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12690,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江畔濯缨亭赠柳常侍 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"一抹青山堕酒卮，濯缨人醉弄涟漪。\n莫惊常侍仍呼柳，曾赋沧波太液池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12691,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江畔濯缨亭赠柳常侍 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"汉江堤畔草芊芊，蜡屐登山醉欲眠。\n天际香垆君自见，可能身染玉京烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12692,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大廷尉孙公山甫闻予阅兵以六绝句见遗此皆公节制之师予乐观厥成耳辄勉奉酬以伸感谢 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"大府横开汉水滨，天王三锡玺书新。\n君看猛士如云拥，来听轻裘缓带人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12693,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大廷尉孙公山甫闻予阅兵以六绝句见遗此皆公节制之师予乐观厥成耳辄勉奉酬以伸感谢 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"山蟠庸汉带中州，水压襄荆控上游。\n谋帅自来先礼乐，干城元不要公侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12694,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大廷尉孙公山甫闻予阅兵以六绝句见遗此皆公节制之师予乐观厥成耳辄勉奉酬以伸感谢 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"三千组练控雕弧，竦立辕门听若无。\n阅罢不须鞭贯耳，此军原属斗于菟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12695,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大廷尉孙公山甫闻予阅兵以六绝句见遗此皆公节制之师予乐观厥成耳辄勉奉酬以伸感谢 其四","author":"王世贞","text":"南阳溪子镞如矛，板楯巴賨虎见愁。\n俱道普天无白羽，技成何处觅封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12696,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大廷尉孙公山甫闻予阅兵以六绝句见遗此皆公节制之师予乐观厥成耳辄勉奉酬以伸感谢 其五","author":"王世贞","text":"叠鼓鸣笳汉水浑，牙前飞将按三门。\n怪来全似吴宫队，旧帅从知也姓孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12697,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大廷尉孙公山甫闻予阅兵以六绝句见遗此皆公节制之师予乐观厥成耳辄勉奉酬以伸感谢 其六","author":"王世贞","text":"郧山增色水增波，为是清风吉甫多。\n江汉自来周雅地，可教新句入铙歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12698,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽程广文三绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"九歌垂就涕先零，恨杀青衫到底青。\n昨夜微茫牛斗分，不知飞上作何星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12699,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽程广文三绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"满地春风避草庐，悠然一梦已蘧蘧。\n由来秘器东园美，不匣侬家万卷书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12700,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽程广文三绝句 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"三绝风流数郑虔，到头生事仅寒毡。\n古来文苑君知否，一卷残编了百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":12701,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]